TITLE Equilibrate 100C Ca solution with calcite+gypsum+aragonite and gas phase at 25C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 0.05
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0
    Gypsum 0 0
    Aragonite 0 0
GAS_PHASE 1
    -temperature 25
    -volume 1
    CO2(g) 1
    CH4(g) 5
    H2S(g) 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.tsv
    -reset false
    -pH true
    -totals Ca C S
    -gases CO2(g) CH4(g) H2S(g)
END
